### INSTRUÇÕES RÁPIDAS
### 1) Obtenha um JWT via sua rota de login (ex.: POST /auth/login) e cole em @JWT_TOKEN
### 2) Substitua {{stageId}}, {{taskId}}, {{projectId}} e {{assigneeUserId}} conforme seu ambiente
### 3) Se receber 404, confirme se está usando /stages/{id} (plural) e se o recurso pertence ao usuário

### ============================================================
### TASKS CRUD – vinculadas a Stage (use as variáveis acima)
### ============================================================

### Exemplo: obter projeto
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### Listar etapas de um projeto
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 1. Criar tarefa em uma etapa
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Escavação da fundação",
  "description": "Executar escavação mecânica para sapatas e blocos",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "TODO",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-01",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-06-05",
  "assigneeName": "{{assigneeName}}"
}

### 2. Listar tarefas da etapa
GET {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 3. Obter tarefa específica
GET {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 4. Atualizar tarefa (PATCH parcial)
PATCH {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "assigneeUserId": {{assigneeUserId}}
}

### 5. Concluir tarefa (exemplo rápido)
PATCH {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### 6. Remover tarefa
DELETE {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### ============================================================
### EXEMPLOS DE ERRO / VALIDAÇÃO (use as mesmas variáveis)
### ============================================================

### 7. Erro: título em branco
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Tarefa sem título",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "TODO",
  "assigneeUserId": {{assigneeUserId}}
}

### 8. Erro: prioridade inválida
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Tarefa com prioridade inválida",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "TODO",
  "assigneeUserId": {{assigneeUserId}}
}

### 9. Erro: status inválido
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Tarefa com status inválido",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "WAITING",
  "assigneeUserId": {{assigneeUserId}}
}

### 10. Erro: datas planejadas inválidas
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Datas inválidas",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "TODO",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-10",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-06-01",
  "assigneeUserId": {{assigneeUserId}}
}

### 11. Erro: responsável sem role ENG
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Responsável inválido",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "TODO",
  "assigneeUserId": 4
}

### 11b. Exemplo: responsável externo sem cadastro
POST {{host}}/stages/{{stageId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Serviço do pedreiro",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "TODO",
  "assigneeName": "{{assigneeName}}"
}

### 12. Erro: etapa inexistente
POST {{host}}/stages/99999/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Tarefa em etapa inexistente",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "TODO",
  "assigneeUserId": {{assigneeUserId}}
}

